             homogeneous BY DESIGN (SS4.2 retrieves within the target level).
             The finding is about CLASSIFICATION, where homogeneity destroys the
             decision; ours is GENERATION with no labels attached, where
             homogeneity is the conditioning signal. Cited with that boundary
             stated explicitly, because the surface pattern matches ours and a
             reader will notice it.}
}

