  journal = {arXiv preprint arXiv:2602.08033},
  year    = {2026},
  note    = {Abstract only, 2026-08-11 via alphaXiv. Answers "absolute criteria
             or comparative judgement?" with BOTH: combining the two forms
             beats either alone. This is the warrant for the axis definition's
             final shape -- a prototype description (rating-like) PLUS the swap
